      source: "Press photograph 'Ile des cygnes, 5/9/20, [Duke] Kahanamoku' by Agence Rol (glass negative, Paris, 5 September 1920), Bibliotheque nationale de France, Gallica, ark:/12148/btv1b53051776b. The 6103 x 8702 pixel scan was cropped to the sitter's head and torso and downscaled to 978 x 1200 with no upscaling.",
